From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 02:29:09 +0200
Subject: [sailfishos][embedlite] Export platform frame methods

The tokenized frame methods are non-virtual to preserve EmbedLiteWindow's
existing vtable ABI. Export their Linux C++ symbols so the external Qt
embedder can resolve them from libxul.
---
 toolkit/library/libxul.symbols | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols b/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
index 167ddb9cf349e..2aba290e6544f 100644
--- a/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
+++ b/toolkit/library/libxul.symbols
@@ -1,5 +1,11 @@
 XRE_GetBootstrap
 XRE_GetEmbedLite
+#if defined(MOZ_EMBEDLITE) && defined(XP_LINUX) && !defined(ANDROID)
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow20AcquirePlatformFrame*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow20ReleasePlatformFrame*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow24SetPlatformFrameListener*
+_ZN7mozilla9embedlite15EmbedLiteWindow31SetPlatformFrameDeliveryEnabled*
+#endif
 uprofiler_get
 #ifdef XP_IOS
 MainProcessInit
